.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfvars
backend.tf

# Exception: per-cell input files under cells/** are committed — they hold only
# non-secret infra identifiers (VPC/subnet/OIDC/cluster + an Omnistrate role ARN)
# and drive the dev bootstrap apply / "Release Omnistrate Bootstrap Dev" Action.
# Allow-list each file EXPLICITLY (not a broad glob) so a future secret-bearing
# tfvars under cells/ can never be un-ignored by accident.
!cells/hc-fmnwao4ct/hc-fmnwao4ct.tfvars

# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed for this root module. pavo-bootstrap-aws
# is a customer-applied root module distributed as a release artefact via the
# sync-bootstrap-mirror workflow. Committing the lock file ensures every customer
# `terraform init` against the same tag resolves identical provider versions —
# without it, provider selection can drift across "identical" tagged releases.
